  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Pick and finely chop rosemary (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84223defeabaeea85c67d/step-28036300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook carrot and zucchini, stirring, until tender, 4-6 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84223defeabaeea85c67d/step-39e46210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add diced tomatoes, risoni, garlic & herb seasoning, Nan’s special seasoning, the chilli flakes (if using), rosemary, the water and brown sugar.\n• Stir to combine, then bring to a boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium-high and simmer, stirring frequently, until risoni is ‘al dente’, 12-15 mins.\n• Stir through the butter and baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84223defeabaeea85c67d/step-ab5c1820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie risoni soup between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84223defeabaeea85c67d/step-390bd630.jpg"
    }
  ]
